    "detailed_description": "All of Hamster Chef\u2019s friends are hungry! Only YOU can satisfy their craving.<br><br>In <strong><i>Go! Go! Hamster Chef!</i></strong> you take the role of Hamster Chef, a plucky young entrepreneur who\u2019s out to make and deliver food to all the animals in the village. Find ingredients, cook dishes, and deliver them to your hungry friends!<br><br>It\u2019s completely innocent!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/f72d84e71650f8dc9ed8f03c2f8099a3.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br>Your village overflows with the bounty of nature! Fresh ingredients are yours for the taking. Just pop them into your cheek pouches and take them home to your kitchen.<br><br>I don\u2019t think you\u2019ll ever run out of yummy ingredients to find! Take, take, take, Hamster Chef!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/7560a9eed35af82a6d8e64e5b246dee0.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br>Your kitchen is the envy of the town! Use your state-of-the-art appliances and transform your ingredients into dishes that are sure to make your friends\u2019 mouths water!<br><br>Get the recipe right, Hamster Chef! You\u2019d better not make any mistakes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/51c5d501c3f8ea2a5fc70f704ba165fe.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br>Hop on your radical scooter and book it to your friends\u2019 homes. You have hungry mouths to feed!<br><br>Stay on the roads for maximum speed. You\u2019d better not wander off if you know what\u2019s good for you, Hamster Chef!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/ab63d9b48e8686d5bd2824eeb546344a.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/1aabbefed0cf18fd9ed13d0e0ba7c4ca.avif?t=1724092899\" width=553 height=970 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/4aa655bdf98a2781cced3a0c0edd90fa.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br><strong><i>Go! Go! Hamster Chef!</i></strong> was created for an N64-style game jam in just 45 days. Since then, it\u2019s been streamed and recorded by over 300 content creators and gathered over 5 million views!<br><br>For this Steam release, we\u2019ve rolled out a number of fixes and improvements and also created brand new end-game content! Now\u2019s your chance to experience the definitive version of <strong><i>Go! Go! Hamster Chef!</i></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "All of Hamster Chef\u2019s friends are hungry! Only YOU can satisfy their craving.<br><br>In <strong><i>Go! Go! Hamster Chef!</i></strong> you take the role of Hamster Chef, a plucky young entrepreneur who\u2019s out to make and deliver food to all the animals in the village. Find ingredients, cook dishes, and deliver them to your hungry friends!<br><br>It\u2019s completely innocent!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/f72d84e71650f8dc9ed8f03c2f8099a3.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br>Your village overflows with the bounty of nature! Fresh ingredients are yours for the taking. Just pop them into your cheek pouches and take them home to your kitchen.<br><br>I don\u2019t think you\u2019ll ever run out of yummy ingredients to find! Take, take, take, Hamster Chef!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/7560a9eed35af82a6d8e64e5b246dee0.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br>Your kitchen is the envy of the town! Use your state-of-the-art appliances and transform your ingredients into dishes that are sure to make your friends\u2019 mouths water!<br><br>Get the recipe right, Hamster Chef! You\u2019d better not make any mistakes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/51c5d501c3f8ea2a5fc70f704ba165fe.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br>Hop on your radical scooter and book it to your friends\u2019 homes. You have hungry mouths to feed!<br><br>Stay on the roads for maximum speed. You\u2019d better not wander off if you know what\u2019s good for you, Hamster Chef!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/ab63d9b48e8686d5bd2824eeb546344a.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/1aabbefed0cf18fd9ed13d0e0ba7c4ca.avif?t=1724092899\" width=553 height=970 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888860/extras/4aa655bdf98a2781cced3a0c0edd90fa.avif?t=1724092899\" width=571 height=101 /></span><br><br><strong><i>Go! Go! Hamster Chef!</i></strong> was created for an N64-style game jam in just 45 days. Since then, it\u2019s been streamed and recorded by over 300 content creators and gathered over 5 million views!<br><br>For this Steam release, we\u2019ve rolled out a number of fixes and improvements and also created brand new end-game content! Now\u2019s your chance to experience the definitive version of <strong><i>Go! Go! Hamster Chef!</i></strong>",
